{"id":51762,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=51762"},"modified":"2026-08-27T15:56:10","modified_gmt":"2026-08-27T14:56:10","slug":"maratona-do-algarve","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/maratona-do-algarve\/","title":{"rendered":"Maratona do Algarve 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: PROVA Maratona do Algarve 2026 --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre a <span style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Maratona do Algarve 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Maratona do Algarve 2026<\/strong> \u00e9 um dos grandes destaques do calend\u00e1rio desportivo de Dezembro de 2026. Realizada na envolvente de Vilamoura \/ Quarteira (Loul\u00e9) (Distrito de Faro), a prova re\u00fane atletas e entusiastas num ambiente vibrante de celebra\u00e7\u00e3o desportiva e competi\u00e7\u00e3o saud\u00e1vel.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O percurso proporciona um excelente desafio, combinando zonas r\u00e1pidas com o apoio caloroso do p\u00fablico local. Para descobrires outros eventos de refer\u00eancia na regi\u00e3o, explora o nosso guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">meias maratonas<\/a> e consulta o <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calendario-de-corridas\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">calend\u00e1rio de corridas em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Garante a tua presen\u00e7a e prepara\u00e7\u00e3o log\u00edstica para viveres uma jornada inesquec\u00edvel de supera\u00e7\u00e3o e conv\u00edvio desportivo em Vilamoura \/ Quarteira (Loul\u00e9).<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica<\/h3>\n<ul style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 12px; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 120px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 Data da Prova:<\/strong> <span style=\"color: #CBD5E1;\">06\/12\/2026 (Domingo)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 120px;\">\ud83d\udccd Localidade:<\/strong> <span style=\"color: #CBD5E1;\">Vilamoura \/ Quarteira (Loul\u00e9) (Distrito de Faro)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 120px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Dist\u00e2ncias:<\/strong> <span style=\"color: #CBD5E1;\">42,195 km (Maratona), 21,097 km (Meia) e 10 km<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 120px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f Hor\u00e1rio Partida:<\/strong> <span style=\"color: #CBD5E1;\">08h30<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"display: flex; gap: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF; min-width: 120px;\">\u26f0\ufe0f Piso \/ Relevo:<\/strong> <span style=\"color: #CBD5E1;\">Asfalto 100% plano pela Marina de Vilamoura e Quarteira<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da Prova &#038; Percurso<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O tra\u00e7ado da <strong>Maratona do Algarve 2026<\/strong> foi desenhado para proporcionar uma corrida regular e motivadora pelas art\u00e9rias principais e patrim\u00f3nio de Vilamoura \/ Quarteira (Loul\u00e9).<\/p>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border-left: 4px solid #8B5CF6; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 16px;\">\n<h4 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 16px;\">\ud83c\udf24\ufe0f Clima &#038; Condi\u00e7\u00f5es Previstas da \u00c9poca<\/h4>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">Em Dezembro, as temperaturas em Vilamoura \/ Quarteira (Loul\u00e9) situam-se habitualmente entre 6\u00b0C e 14\u00b0C, sendo aconselh\u00e1vel aquecimento pr\u00e9vio adequado e vestu\u00e1rio t\u00e9rmico leve.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-calc-event-banner\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.12); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 16px; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div>\n<h4 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0 0 6px 0; font-size: 18px;\">\u23f1\ufe0f Prepara o teu ritmo para a Maratona do Algarve 2026<\/h4>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin: 0; font-size: 14px;\">Calcula o teu tempo estimado e parciais com a nossa ferramenta oficial.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B5CF6 0%, #7C3AED 100%); color: #FFFFFF; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 10px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 14px;\" target=\"_blank\">Calculadora de Pace \u2192<\/a>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udfe8 Onde Ficar (Alojamento Recomendado)<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Para garantir conforto e boa log\u00edstica no dia da prova em <strong>Vilamoura \/ Quarteira (Loul\u00e9)<\/strong>, sugerimos a reserva de alojamento nas seguintes zonas estrat\u00e9gicas:<\/p>\n<ul style=\"color: #CBD5E1; line-height: 1.7; padding-left: 20px; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Marina de Vilamoura &#038; Altimetria Beira-Mar:<\/strong> Ideal para desloca\u00e7\u00f5es a p\u00e9 no dia da prova e aquecimento sem stresse de tr\u00e2nsito.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Cal\u00e7ad\u00e3o de Quarteira &#038; Praia da Fal\u00e9sia:<\/strong> Excelente escolha para atletas e acompanhantes que pretendem desfrutar de restaura\u00e7\u00e3o e turismo local.<\/li>\n<li style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #FFFFFF;\">Acessos \u00e0 N125 e Via do Infante (A22):<\/strong> Recomendado para quem viaja de carro ou necessita de liga\u00e7\u00e3o r\u00e1pida \u00e0 rede de transportes.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\ud83c\udf0d Sobre o Local &#038; Gastronomia Regional<\/h3>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Ap\u00f3s cortar a linha de meta em Vilamoura \/ Quarteira (Loul\u00e9), aproveite para celebrar o esfor\u00e7o e explorar o patrim\u00f3nio ic\u00f3nico (Marina de Vilamoura, Praia da Fal\u00e9sia e Ru\u00ednas Romanas do Cerro da Vila). Especialidades imperd\u00edveis da regi\u00e3o incluem: <strong>Cataplana Algarvia, Xanfana de Peixe, Dom Rodrigos e Tortas de Alfarroba<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border-left: 4px solid #C4B5FD; padding: 16px; border-radius: 8px; margin-top: 16px;\">\n<h4 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0 0 8px 0; font-size: 16px;\">\ud83d\udc65 Guia de Acompanhantes &#038; Espectadores<\/h4>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin: 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.6;\">Os melhores pontos de apoio para a fam\u00edlia assistir concentram-se junto \u00e0 zona de partida\/meta e nas pra\u00e7as centrais de Vilamoura \/ Quarteira (Loul\u00e9).<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-section\" style=\"margin-top: 32px;\">\n<h3 style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">Perguntas <span style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes<\/span><\/h3>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;\">1. Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da Maratona do Algarve 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.6;\">A prova realiza-se no dia <strong>06\/12\/2026 (Domingo)<\/strong> em <strong>Vilamoura \/ Quarteira (Loul\u00e9) (Distrito de Faro)<\/strong>, com a partida marcada para as <strong>08h30<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;\">2. Onde \u00e9 feito o levantamento do kit de atleta e dorsal?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.6;\">O secretariado e a entrega de dorsais funcionam no <strong>Centro de Eventos de Vilamoura \/ Marina<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;\">3. Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e o tipo de piso do percurso?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.6;\">O evento conta com as dist\u00e2ncias de <strong>42,195 km (Maratona), 21,097 km (Meia) e 10 km<\/strong>, disputadas em piso de <strong>Asfalto 100% plano pela Marina de Vilamoura e Quarteira<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;\">4. Onde posso consultar os resultados e fotos oficiais da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.6;\">As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es finais e a galeria de fotografias oficiais poder\u00e3o ser acedidas no portal <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\" target=\"_blank\">Portugal Running<\/a> ap\u00f3s o encerramento do evento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer;\">5. A prova disponibiliza abastecimentos e apoio aos atletas?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; margin-top: 12px; line-height: 1.6;\">Sim, a organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza <strong>Abastecimentos de 5 em 5 km com \u00e1gua, gel e isot\u00f3nico<\/strong>, al\u00e9m de cobertura de seguro desportivo e assist\u00eancia m\u00e9dica oficial durante toda a prova.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: PROVA Maratona do Algarve 2026 --><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":51764,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,31,41],"event_type_2":[728,149,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-51762","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-loule-faro","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-maratona","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-faro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/712686450_122095024437355656_1439542731990185449_n.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51762","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrun